{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13224400","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322440001:1":{"text":"우리는 이 땅에서 태어나 진정으로 행복을 누려본 적이 없다. 추위와 굶주림, 그리고 가난은 한 순간도 우리를 떠난 적이 없었지!","source_cn":"我们生在这片土地上从来没有真正幸福过，寒冷，饥饿，贫穷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB9D342ECE3F8C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322440002:0":{"text":"우리가 고통받고 있었을 때 듀라 여신은 어디에 있었는가? 그대들도 듀라가 우리를 지켜본 적이 없었다는 것을 의심해본 적이 있지 않은가!","source_cn":"我们受苦的时候艾雅在哪里？你是否跟我一样怀疑过艾雅从未...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF816A38AFC5C8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322440003:1":{"text":"위대한 신을 찬미하라. 위대한 의지만이 우리를 인도할 것이다!","source_cn":"赞美伟大真神，只有伟大意志才会指引我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C26530C87842B45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322440004:1":{"text":"위대한 신을 찬미하라!","source_cn":"赞美伟大真神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95674434202EEFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439001:":{"text":"모두 점점 힘이 빠질 것이다.","source_cn":"你们感到虚弱","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ADAE30D80F645C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439002:":{"text":"왜냐하면 나약한 육체에 속박된 존재이기 때문이다!","source_cn":"因为你们是肉体凡躯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5771BDF45720833F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439003:":{"text":"위대한 신을 믿어라!","source_cn":"信仰伟大真神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x108880FC5F5E0FF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:9:1322439004:":{"text":"우리의 영혼을 인도하라!","source_cn":"引渡我们的灵魂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x561228FB3FEEBEE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322440005:1":{"text":"인도자님, 이교도 하나를 붙잡았습니다. 어떻게 처분할까요?","source_cn":"引导者大人，我们抓到了一位异教徒，该如何处置？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71228625164ABA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322440006:1":{"text":"그렇게 말하지 말거라. 이교도 따위는 존재하지 않는다. 그들은 단지 잠시 길을 잃었을 뿐이야.","source_cn":"别这样说，根本不存在什么异教徒，他们只是短暂的迷失了方...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9598E659B398D020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322440007:1":{"text":"나를 보아라, 아이야. 내가 무엇을 도와줄 수 있겠느냐?","source_cn":"看着我，孩子，我能帮助你做些什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B6CAEB8F64971B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322440008:1":{"text":"사, 사람을... 잡... 찾아야...","source_cn":"我……我……捉、找人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F201471EE1E323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322440009:1":{"text":"뭐? 사람을 잡으러 와? 설마 소란을 피우러 온 건가?!","source_cn":"你说什么？捉人？难道是来找事的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43902165FDD3C2E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322440010:1":{"text":"발음이 서툴 뿐이니 진정하도록 해라.","source_cn":"冷静，她只是口齿不清罢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DEFCE758CF9D4F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322440011:1":{"text":"레프, 오빠를... 찾아야...","source_cn":"找……找列夫哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA790A1E245827B5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322440012:1":{"text":"레프를 찾아러 왔다는 말이냐? 그렇다면 네가 이리나겠구나!","source_cn":"你的意思是，来找列夫的吗？哈！原来你就是伊琳娜是吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1B60AB47C534BC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322440013:1":{"text":"레프 오빠를... 알아?","source_cn":"你认识……列夫哥哥？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49F021DF111A8B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1322440014:1":{"text":"알다마다. 떠돌이 레프를 말하는 게지? 그는 원래 음유시인이었지만 여행 중에 다리가 동상에 걸려 고칠 수 없는 상처를 입었지.","source_cn":"当然孩子，当然。列夫是个流浪汉，对吗？他原本是个吟游诗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD95C98568DCBFA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1322440015:1":{"text":"불쌍하기도 하지... 처음 만났을 때 그가 자신의 다리를 치료하기를 바랄 줄 알았지. 하지만 그는 망설임 없이 네 말더듬을 고쳐 달라고 하더구나.","source_cn":"真是个可怜人……我第一次见到他，还一位他的愿望是治好自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7472271CAEABED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1322440016:1":{"text":"레프... 오빠...","source_cn":"列夫……哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24402C56A835FCF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1322440017:1":{"text":"이 얼마나 선량하고 이타적인 자란 말인가! 위대한 신께서 레프에게 응답하시어 그를 낙원으로 이끄셨다!","source_cn":"多么善良无私的人啊，伟大真神已经回应了列夫！将他带到了乐园！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93440C4BADDDD960","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1322440018:1":{"text":"신부님, 하지만 이 아이는 여전히 말을 더듬고 있습니다만...","source_cn":"神父，但这女孩的口疾也没好不是吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41E1F8FA51F39E5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1322440019:1":{"text":"맞아요. 레프는 어디로 갔죠?","source_cn":"是啊，所以列夫去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729D7126B57A58B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1322440020:1":{"text":"길을 잃은 자들이여... 너희는 이미 신의 기적 속에 있으면서도, 그 기적이 일어나고 있다는 것조차 모르는구나.","source_cn":"迷途的人啊……你们身在神迹中，却不知神迹已经发生着。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67E78FD996CA9BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1322440021:1":{"text":"그녀가 이곳에 온 이유를 생각해 본 적이 있는가? 이 모든 것은 위대한 의지의 섭리다. 그녀를 우리 앞으로 데려오신 것도, 그녀의 말더듬이 치유될 것도, 모두 신의 뜻이니라!","source_cn":"你们有没有想过她为什么会出现这？这一切都是伟大意志的调...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE81ED3D8420A221B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1322440022:1":{"text":"위대한 의지를 찬미하라!","source_cn":"赞美伟大意志！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D629139474B9343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1322440023:1":{"text":"위대한 신을 찬미하라!","source_cn":"赞美伟大真神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95674434202EEFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1322440024:1":{"text":"아이야, 약속대로 너를 의식에 초대하마. 함께할 생각이 있느냐?","source_cn":"孩子，按照约定，我必须邀请你参加祭祀，你愿意来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2CFF2BA869BCE0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1322440025:1":{"text":"레프 오빠, 좋아... 의식은, 싫어...","source_cn":"我……要列夫哥哥，不要……祭祀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F66C14994DA0BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1322440026:1":{"text":"아이야, 네 병을 고치기 위해 너의 레프 오빠는 시험을 마치고 낙원으로 떠났단다. 설마 그가 겪은 고통을 헛되이 만들고 싶은 것이냐?","source_cn":"孩子，为了能治好你的病，你的列夫哥哥已经完成了考验，前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x998B260540EE2DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1322440027:1":{"text":"낙원...?","source_cn":"乐园……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2A7D45BAFCF644B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1322440028:1":{"text":"그래! 그곳은 추위도 가난도 없는, 따뜻하고 풍요로운 진정한 낙원이지!","source_cn":"是的！那是一个没有寒冷贫穷，一个温暖富饶的地方，是真正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D40BDA9A2224B40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1322440029:1":{"text":"오직 위대한 의지를 충실하게 믿고, 그 인도를 받는다면 모두가 낙원의 선택을 받을 수 있는 것이다!","source_cn":"只要虔诚地信仰伟大意志，得到伟大意志的引渡，你们都会成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4552BA1B3CF1CCD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1322440030:1":{"text":"그리고, 나의 아이 이리나야. 너도 곧 레프 오빠와 낙원에서 만날 수 있을 것이란다.","source_cn":"而你，我的孩子伊琳娜，你会与你的列夫哥哥在乐园团聚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC54BAC9CAE9696FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1322440031:1":{"text":"신실한 신도들이여! 며칠 후면 위대한 신의 날이 도래한다! 우리는 검은 늪 숲에서 모든 신실한 신도들을 기다릴 것이다!","source_cn":"诸位信众，再过几天便是神的伟大时日！我们将在黑沼森林恭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D796548A0034E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:13052415:0":{"text":"이교도 교주가 마을 주민들에게 전도하던 중, 한 이교도가 이리나를 그의 옆으로 데려갔다.","source_cn":"邪教首领向镇民们传教时，一位邪教徒将伊琳娜带到了他的旁边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73E3F67CA0A2C463","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兹比格涅夫":{"text":"자네우스","source":"兹比格涅夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:癫狂的镇民":{"text":"광기에 빠진 마을 주민","source":"癫狂的镇民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:神志不清的镇民":{"text":"정신이 혼미한 마을 주민","source":"神志不清的镇民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:邪教徒守卫":{"text":"이교도 수비병","source":"邪教徒守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊琳娜":{"text":"이리나","source":"伊琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":41,"localized_text_count":36,"speaker_count":6}}